# RDAP-Q Protocol Hints for Block Goose

Use the RDAP-Q Agent Engineering Protocol for non-trivial software engineering tasks:
- Skill: rdap-q-skill/SKILL.md
- Manifest: manifest.json
- Command: /rdapq <task>
- Follow evidence-first verification before concluding tasks.
- Keep execution state updated in .rdapq/state/.
- Respect exit criteria: Stop when hard gates pass and marginal improvement is < 0.15.
